	// Why a refused claim stays held. The engine's reasons: unresolved (a name
	// in it is matched to no one record: settle that name), legal_form (a name
	// is linked only by its legal form, on a link that holds one value: settle
	// that name), part_name and own_name (a name is linked only by part of a
	// record's name, or only by an identifier that is the name the text calls
	// it by, whatever the link holds: settle that name), changed (the claim
